error[DS0123]: unknown join kind `cross`
  --> query:1:33
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | join kind = cross 'customers.csv' on customerId
  |                                 ^^^^^ not a join kind
  |
  = note: the join kinds are `inner`, `leftouter`, `rightouter`, `fullouter`, `leftsemi`, `leftanti`, `rightsemi` and `rightanti`
